WEBVTT

00:00.580 --> 00:02.439
Hey, my name is Uthman Salama.

00:03.048 --> 00:06.224
I build websites and practical tools
that make everyday work easier.

00:06.977 --> 00:12.004
My background is in technology coordination and operations,
so I care about how a website looks

00:12.437 --> 00:13.664
and how it supports your business.

00:14.405 --> 00:20.412
Whether you need a clear business website, an interactive form,
a calculator, or a better way to organise your projects,

00:20.735 --> 00:23.422
I can help you turn your idea
into something useful.

00:24.701 --> 00:28.910
You can explore examples of my work in my portfolio,
including a business website,

00:29.493 --> 00:30.427
a survey dashboard,

00:30.876 --> 00:32.599
and a freelancer project hub.

00:33.932 --> 00:39.889
Just send me a message, tell me what you’re working on,
and let’s talk about it, and let’s do and build what you need.
